<Project>

  <Import Project="$([MSBuild]::GetPathOfFileAbove('Directory.Build.props', '$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)../'))" />

  <!-- Packaging, for every package under src/. Versions come from git tags (MinVer): tag v2027.0.0 to release
       2027.0.0; an untagged build is 2027.0.0-alpha.0.<height>. All packages release together at one version, under the
       policy in docs/guide/versioning.md; docs/releasing.md is the release runbook. Each .csproj adds its Description,
       its own tags after these, and its README. -->

  <PropertyGroup Label="Package">
    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
    <Authors>Soma Osvay</Authors>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2018-2026 the WriteableFileProviders contributors</Copyright>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/serionist/WriteableFileProviders</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/serionist/WriteableFileProviders.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <!-- What every package is found by on nuget.org; each .csproj adds its own after these. -->
    <PackageTags>ifileprovider;fileprovider;filesystem;file-storage;storage;cloud-storage;upload;download;signed-url;writeable</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>What each release changed: https://github.com/serionist/WriteableFileProviders/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md. Moving from 2026.x: https://github.com/serionist/WriteableFileProviders/blob/main/docs/migration-2027.md</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <MinVerTagPrefix>v</MinVerTagPrefix>
    <MinVerMinimumMajorMinor>2027.0</MinVerMinimumMajorMinor>
    <MinVerDefaultPreReleaseIdentifiers>alpha.0</MinVerDefaultPreReleaseIdentifiers>
    <!-- Package validation runs on every pack. With one target framework and no baseline it checks the package's own
         consistency; once 2027.0.0 ships, PackageValidationBaselineVersion set to it also checks every later package
         against what consumers have (docs/releasing.md, "After a major release"). -->
    <EnablePackageValidation>true</EnablePackageValidation>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="MinVer" PrivateAssets="all" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- The package icon, rendered from docs/assets/icon.svg by eng/render-assets.sh. -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)..\docs\assets\icon.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="/" Visible="false" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
